{
  "iri": "https://strandz.it/jigdaw/plugins/ground/",
  "label": "Ground",
  "comment": "Transport synced long-form bass generator. Form shapes and phrase roles plan a whole section that plays in time with the session, with arc tension and Conductor control including scene-driven role overrides.",
  "vendor": "danja",
  "developer": "http://danny.ayers.name",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "registeredName": "ground",
  "roles": [
    "trn:MidiGenerator"
  ],
  "accepts": [
    "trn:ControlMidi"
  ],
  "produces": [
    "trn:Midi",
    "trn:BassMidi"
  ],
  "genres": [
    "Dub",
    "Jazz",
    "Fugue",
    "Rock"
  ],
  "cautions": [
    "Silent until the host transport is rolling and reports a tempo and a beat position. A generator with no idea what time it is would be guessing, and this one says so by producing nothing.",
    "Pure MIDI, no audio: route its MIDI output to a bass instrument. New Form, New Phrase and Mutate Cell are triggers that fire on the rising edge, so each press is one action.",
    "Monophonic by design. A new note ends the note before it rather than overlapping."
  ],
  "format": "trn:WebAudio",
  "licenceId": "Apache-2.0",
  "abi": "jig:Abi2",
  "requires": [
    "jig:MidiEvents",
    "jig:MidiOut",
    "trn:HostTransport"
  ],
  "prefers": [],
